{"slug": "how-many-google-reviews-does-a-contractor-need", "title": "How Many Google Reviews Does a Contractor Need? | ScaleLocal", "description": "What the 2026 data actually says about how many Google reviews a contractor needs to rank in the map pack — and why recency beats the raw number.", "card_blurb": "What the data says about the review count you need to rank — and why recency beats the number.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>How Many Google Reviews Does a Contractor Need? | ScaleLocal</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"What the 2026 data actually says about how many Google reviews a contractor needs to rank in the map pack — and why recency beats the raw number.\">\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.scalelocal.net/blog/how-many-google-reviews-does-a-contractor-need/\">\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.svg\">\n  <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/favicon-32.png\">\n  <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\">\n  <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"ScaleLocal\">\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How Many Google Reviews Does a Contractor Need to Rank?\">\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"What the 2026 data actually says about how many Google reviews a contractor needs to rank in the map pack — and why recency beats the raw number.\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.scalelocal.net/og-image.png\">\n  <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.scalelocal.net/blog/how-many-google-reviews-does-a-contractor-need/\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.scalelocal.net/og-image.png\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\